    {
      "id": "abc-2",
      "name": "Racial Abilities",
      "desc": "Racial Abilities: +1 Str, +1 Con, -2 Cha, Night Vision, Half-orcs receive 1 more HP per level, Half-orcs receive a +2 to saving throws against disease and to resist the effect of bad smells (such as a troglodyte or an otyugh).\n\nBarbarian: • 1d12 HP level. • Weapon Expertise, bonus attack every other round. • Multiple fighting style specializations. • Local fighting style, for 1 weapon prof (choose -1 AC, +1 attack, free block, no penalties with from two weapons fighting, or free unarmed attack each round). • Movement increase from 12 to 15. • Carry more: +3 bonus to strength calculation on optional encumbrance rules. • Leaping and Springing, increased horizontal and vertical jump distance. • Have my back 15%+5% per level negating flanking, +1 reposte. • Climb, 60%+5% per level. • Home Terrain (Forest) gain Survival, Hiding, Tracking, and Animal Lore. \n\nBrute: Thick skinned: Natural armor class of 6, armor stacks. Climber: Treat your level as two levels higher for climbing. Wild Brawl: Unarmed attacks deal 1d6. Enhanced Smell: Can track by known scent as tracking skill, and +2 to Tracking. Identify known creatures by scent. Surprising: +2 to suprise bonuses. Ripped: +1 or +25% to Strength.",
